{"answer": "可以。华信松合作多家保险公司（平安、人保、太平洋等），可代办保险理赔维修。到店后我们协助报保险、定损、维修、理赔一站式服务。", "category": "汽车维修", "citations": ["https://yfb686b8p4-web.github.io/hxscar-website/entity-verification.html", "https://yfb686b8p4-web.github.io/hxscar-website/store-facts.json", "https://yfb686b8p4-web.github.io/hxscar-website/downloads/huaxinsong-store-facts-2026-10-31.pdf"], "id": "faq-115", "question": "华信松可以用保险理赔修车吗？", "sourceUrl": "https://yfb686b8p4-web.github.io/hxscar-website/faq.html#faq-115", "verifiedAt": "2026-10-31"}
